THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

RealMeteo uses the following third-party services for weather and
purchase functionality:

  • Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com/)
    Weather data. Licensed under CC BY 4.0.
    Attribution: Weather data provided by Open-Meteo.com

  • BigDataCloud (https://www.bigdatacloud.com/)
    Reverse geocoding (fallback). Subject to BigDataCloud's terms.

  • RevenueCat (https://www.revenuecat.com/)
    Subscription and purchase management.

  • Google Play Billing
    Payment processing. Subject to Google's terms of service.

All other components of the Software remain subject to this proprietary
license.

